      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Vrchat has midi support, and in your case since you're using an MT32 emulator it tries to initialize it. However it seems that you haven't set up the MT32 emulator or the config of it broke. Either uninstall the MT32 emulator or add the missing Roland ROM.\n\nIf you understood nothing of what I just said, stick to uninstalling any midi emulators you have installed.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
